1
00:00:00,599 --> 00:00:02,479
...call it 30 degrees, so about half.

2
00:00:02,643 --> 00:00:07,103
(Sheldon:)Exactly half.

3
00:00:08,399 --> 00:00:10,399
(Leonard(snarkily):)Let's push.

4
00:00:12,278 --> 00:00:13,778
(Penny:)Okay.

5
00:00:13,946 --> 00:00:16,036
(Leonard(snarkily):)See, it's moving. This is easy.

6
00:00:16,198 --> 00:00:17,618
It's all in the math.

7
00:00:18,451 --> 00:00:21,241
- What's your formula for the corner?
- What?

8
00:00:23,748 --> 00:00:25,708
(Penny:)Oh, okay.

9
00:00:27,376 --> 00:00:30,966
(Leonard:)Okay, yeah, no problem.
Just come up here, help me pull and turn.

10
00:00:35,301 --> 00:00:38,971
Oh, gravity, thou art a heatless bitch.

11
00:00:40,222 --> 00:00:42,102
(Sheldon:)You do understand
that our efforts here...

12
00:00:42,266 --> 00:00:46,766
(Sheldon:)...will in no way increase the odds of you
having sexual congress with this woman?

13
00:00:47,271 --> 00:00:49,811
(Leonard:)Men do things for women
without expecting sex.

14
00:00:49,982 --> 00:00:52,072
Yeah, those would be men
who just had sex.

15
00:00:53,652 --> 00:00:55,652
I'm doing this to be a good neighbor.

16
00:00:56,655 --> 00:01:02,025
(Leonard:)In any case, there's no way
it could lower the odds.

